WEBVTT

00:04:56.478 --> 00:05:00.065
the more I realized
the pattern in these numbers.

00:05:01.625 --> 00:05:06.385
As if these multiplication tables
were sending me a message,

00:05:06.995 --> 00:05:10.555
I sensed as if these numbers
were talking to me.

00:05:10.555 --> 00:05:15.777
And that's when I figured out the magic
these odd and even numbers have;

00:05:15.777 --> 00:05:18.126
the poetry, the symmetry they have.

00:05:18.826 --> 00:05:20.885
Let me show you what I mean:

00:05:21.495 --> 00:05:24.087
Let's look at table of three for example.